  "blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "agent-axis",
      "block_type": "TABLE",
      "text": "評価対象を失敗の発生層でそろえる。\nScaffolding / interface：七つのagent scaffoldingと五つのlanguage modelを一つのsoftware taskで比較し、repository-state completionとscaffolding依存のcost variationを見る。\nRequirements / planning：SWE-RPGは163 tasks・31 repositoriesでrequirementとplanningの参照を検証し、implicit-requirement recoveryをbottleneckとして診断する。\nFunction call：PluginEvalはdeterministic validation、real API execution、adversarial negativesでfine-grained error attributionを行う。\nTransaction：Agentic Transactionはsemantic atomicity、consistency、isolation、durabilityをagent systemの設計対象として定義する。\nRed teaming / skills：REDAgentBenchはisolated sandboxとstate/receipt verificationで実行可能な攻撃測定を組み、SkillTriageの研究はloaded skillによるfailureとefficiency regressionをpaired differential analysisで帰属する。",
      "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
      "evidence_refs": [
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:64191daff18f36c9","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-arxiv-2608-08654v1","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:a1192a0a6d7d06e9","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-arxiv-2608-09072v1","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:bd686d9ba78445cc","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-arxiv-2608-08700v1","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:80cf0064cd2bd552","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-arxiv-2608-13900v1","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:d0dc6e9e7a558958","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-arxiv-2608-10669v1","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:ead88c2a97a882f2","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-arxiv-2608-11888v1","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": "agent-failure-structure",
      "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "text": "この並べ方から見える共通点は、失敗をagentの内側の一つの能力へ押し込めないことだ。scaffoldingは同じmodelでも作業の進み方とcostを変え、requirements/planningは問題文に埋まった意図の回収を問う。function callはAPIを実際に通して誤りの種類を分解し、transaction設計は長い処理の途中状態を守る。さらにred-team環境は実行結果を検証し、skill研究は追加された手順そのものが機能失敗や効率低下を生む可能性を測る。",
      "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
      "evidence_refs": [
